    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deathly Reprieve is an immersive, story-driven Tactical Shooter. Strategize, adapt, and shoot your way through enemy lines. Lead a mercenary organization through a blood-soaked world, as you uncover a global conspiracy. Do you have what it takes? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player PVE (Player Versus Environment)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun Shooting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talent Tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendly Fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spoken Languages</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subtitles</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Story:</strong><br>You play as &quot;The Valencian&quot;, a high-ranking officer in a mercenary organization. In a near-futuristic world, scarred by countless apocalyptic events, you thrive on the three things that keep you alive: <strong>luxury</strong>, <strong>violence</strong>, and <strong>control</strong>.<br><br>Your <strong>organization</strong> operates on the fringes of morality, using expendable convicts\u2014broken souls made obedient through torture and brainwashing\u2014to bolster its ranks. You lead these disposable soldiers on brutal missions, carrying out the will of their shadowy employer without question.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But once you stumble upon a <strong>secret</strong> you were never meant to find, everything changes. Your organization turns against you and your once-privileged life becomes a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, with your wits, skills and dwindling resources, you must uncover the truth behind a global <strong>conspiracy</strong> that threatens to destroy what\u2019s left of the world. Only then you can <strong>reclaim your life</strong>.   <br>   </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deathly Reprieve is an immersive, story-driven Tactical Shooter. Strategize, adapt, and shoot your way through enemy lines. Lead a mercenary organization through a blood-soaked world, as you uncover a global conspiracy. Do you have what it takes? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Modes</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player PVE (Player Versus Environment)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gun Shooting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Talent Tree</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Friendly Fire</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humor</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spoken Languages</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Subtitles</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >English</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><strong>Story:</strong><br>You play as &quot;The Valencian&quot;, a high-ranking officer in a mercenary organization. In a near-futuristic world, scarred by countless apocalyptic events, you thrive on the three things that keep you alive: <strong>luxury</strong>, <strong>violence</strong>, and <strong>control</strong>.<br><br>Your <strong>organization</strong> operates on the fringes of morality, using expendable convicts\u2014broken souls made obedient through torture and brainwashing\u2014to bolster its ranks. You lead these disposable soldiers on brutal missions, carrying out the will of their shadowy employer without question.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But once you stumble upon a <strong>secret</strong> you were never meant to find, everything changes. Your organization turns against you and your once-privileged life becomes a fight for survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now, with your wits, skills and dwindling resources, you must uncover the truth behind a global <strong>conspiracy</strong> that threatens to destroy what\u2019s left of the world. Only then you can <strong>reclaim your life</strong>.   <br>   </p>",
    "short_description": "Strategize, adapt, and shoot your way through enemy lines. In this ruthless, story-driven tactical shooter, precision is the difference between life and death. Lead a mercenary organization through a blood-soaked, near-futuristic world, as you uncover a global conspiracy. Do you have what it takes?",
